                    </div>
                    <span class="product-status dev"><t key="landing.status.dev">In Development</t></span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="product-name"><t key="landing.b2b.name">B2B Trade Platform</t></h3>
                <p class="product-desc">
                    <t key="landing.b2b.desc">Next-generation B2B marketplace connecting suppliers, buyers, carriers, and service providers across industries worldwide.</t>
                </p>
                <div class="product-features">
                    <span class="product-tag"><i class="bi bi-shop"></i> Marketplace</span>
                    <span class="product-tag"><i class="bi bi-truck"></i> Logistics</span>
