    </section>

    <!-- Kullanım Paketleri — Modül Bazlı (Accordion) -->
    <style>
        details.plk { background:rgba(255,255,255,.02); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08); border-radius:8px; margin-bottom:8px; overflow:hidden; }
        details.plk summary { list-style:none; cursor:pointer; padding:10px 14px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:10px; color:#eee; font-size:.9rem; }
        details.plk summary::-webkit-details-marker { display:none; }
        details.plk summary::after { content:'▾'; color:#7b1fa2; transition:transform .2s; }
        details.plk[open] summary::after { transform:rotate(180deg); }
        details.plk .plk-body { padding:0 14px 12px; color:#bbb; font-size:.85rem; line-height:1.8; }
        details.plk .plk-body ul { margin:0; padding-left:18px; }
        .plk-price { color:#7b1fa2; font-weight:700; }
        .plk-branch-note { background:rgba(123,31,162,.1); border:1px dashed rgba(123,31,162,.4); color:#ce93d8; padding:10px 14px; border-radius:8px; font-size:.82rem; margin-top:12px; }
    </style>
    <section class="pricing-section" id="pricing" style="padding:60px 20px;">
        <div class="section-header">
            <div class="section-badge">Paketler</div>
            <h2 class="section-title">Kullanım Paketleri</h2>
            <p class="section-desc">Modül bazlı fiyatlandırma — başlıklara tıklayarak detayları görüntüleyin. 5 gün ücretsiz deneme.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:20px;max-width:1200px;margin:40px auto 0;">

            <!-- SALON -->
            <div style="background:rgba(123,31,162,.12);border:2px solid #7b1fa2;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;">
                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:4px;">
                    <i class="bi bi-scissors" style="color:#7b1fa2;font-size:1.5rem;"></i>
                    <h3 style="color:#fff;margin:0;">Salon Yönetimi</h3>
                </div>
                <p style="color:#aaa;font-size:.82rem;margin-bottom:14px;">Temel Paket zorunlu, diğer modüller isteğe bağlı</p>

                <details class="plk" open>
                    <summary><span>Temel Paket <span style="color:#4caf50;font-size:.7rem;margin-left:4px;">ZORUNLU</span></span><span class="plk-price">1.700 ₺/ay</span></summary>
                    <div class="plk-body">
                        <details class="plk" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);"><summary><span>Randevu Yönetimi</span></summary><div class="plk-body">Online randevu, QR kod ile şube özel link, bekleme listesi kaydı, SMS hatırlatma.</div></details>
                        <details class="plk" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);"><summary><span>Kasa / POS</span></summary><div class="plk-body">Gelir-gider kaydı, nakit/kart/havale, günlük kapanış raporu.</div></details>
                        <details class="plk" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);"><summary><span>Müşteri Yönetimi</span></summary><div class="plk-body">Müşteri kartı, geçmiş randevu, notlar, iletişim tercihleri, KVKK onay kaydı.</div></details>
                        <details class="plk" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);"><summary><span>Personel Yönetimi</span></summary><div class="plk-body">Çalışan listesi, roller, çalışma saatleri, yetkinlikler/yetenekler.</div></details>
                        <details class="plk" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);"><summary><span>Personel Fiyatları ve Hasılat</span></summary><div class="plk-body">Personel bazlı hizmet fiyatı, komisyon, dönemsel hasılat raporu.</div></details>
                        <details class="plk" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);"><summary><span>Bekleme Listesi</span></summary><div class="plk-body">Müsait saat yoksa müşteri bekleme listesine kaydolur; slot boşalınca bildirim.</div></details>
                        <details class="plk" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);"><summary><span>Seans Paketleri</span></summary><div class="plk-body">Çoklu seans satışı, otomatik seans düşme.</div></details>
                        <details class="plk" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);"><summary><span>No-Show Politikası</span></summary><div class="plk-body">Gelmeyen müşteri için ceza, depozito iptali, kara liste yönetimi.</div></details>
                        <details class="plk" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);"><summary><span>Onay Formları</span></summary><div class="plk-body">KVKK, hizmet rıza formları CRUD, dijital imza + arşiv.</div></details>
                    </div>
                </details>
                <details class="plk">
                    <summary><span>Stok Tedarik / Finans</span><span class="plk-price">400 ₺/ay</span></summary>
                    <div class="plk-body">
                        <details class="plk" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);"><summary><span>Ürün ve Stok</span></summary><div class="plk-body">Ürün kartı, barkod, stok seviyesi, düşük stok uyarısı.</div></details>
                        <details class="plk" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);"><summary><span>Tedarikçi ve Cari</span></summary><div class="plk-body">Tedarikçi kartı, cari hesap, açık borç/alacak takibi.</div></details>
                        <details class="plk" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);"><summary><span>Masraf Takibi</span></summary><div class="plk-body">Kira, fatura, maaş vb. masraf kalemleri; kategori bazlı raporlama.</div></details>
                    </div>
                </details>
                <details class="plk">
                    <summary><span>Müşteri Sadakati / Pazarlama</span><span class="plk-price">1.500 ₺/ay</span></summary>
                    <div class="plk-body">
                        <details class="plk" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);"><summary><span>Hediye Kartları</span></summary><div class="plk-body">Dijital hediye kartı oluşturma, bakiye kullanımı.</div></details>
                        <details class="plk" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);"><summary><span>Üyelik Planları</span></summary><div class="plk-body">Aylık/yıllık üyelik paketleri, otomatik yenileme.</div></details>
                        <details class="plk" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);"><summary><span>Sadakat Programı</span></summary><div class="plk-body">Puan toplama, harcamaya göre seviyeler, ödül kuponları.</div></details>
                        <details class="plk" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);"><summary><span>Pazarlama ve SMS</span></summary><div class="plk-body">Hedef kitle segmentasyonu, SMS kampanyası gönderimi.</div></details>
                        <details class="plk" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);"><summary><span>E-posta Kampanyaları</span></summary><div class="plk-body">Şablon tabanlı e-posta kampanya tasarımı ve gönderim raporu.</div></details>
                        <details class="plk" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);"><summary><span>Yorum Yönetimi</span></summary><div class="plk-body">Randevu sonrası otomatik yorum isteği, onay akışı, halka açık yayın.</div></details>
                        <details class="plk" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);"><summary><span>Kayıp Müşteri Geri Kazanım</span></summary><div class="plk-body">X gün gelmeyen müşterilere otomatik indirim/hatırlatma kampanyası (winback).</div></details>
                        <details class="plk" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);"><summary><span>Önce/Sonra Fotoğrafları</span></summary><div class="plk-body">İşlem öncesi/sonrası görsel arşiv, müşteri karşılaştırma galerisi.</div></details>
                    </div>
                </details>
                <details class="plk">
                    <summary><span>Kurumsal</span><span class="plk-price">200 ₺/ay</span></summary>
                    <div class="plk-body">
                        <details class="plk" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);"><summary><span>Raporlama</span></summary><div class="plk-body">Detaylı analitik raporlar, personel karneleri, hizmet karlılık, trend analizi.</div></details>
                    </div>
                </details>

                <div class="plk-branch-note">
                    <i class="bi bi-buildings me-1"></i>Ek şube için <strong>%10 indirim</strong> — her ek şube aynı modülleri %10 düşük fiyatla kullanır.
                </div>
                <a href="https://sln.corplynk.com/account/register" style="margin-top:14px;padding:10px;background:#7b1fa2;color:#fff;text-align:center;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">5 Gün Ücretsiz Dene</a>
            </div>

            <!-- CALLCENTER -->
            <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:12px;padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;">
                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:4px;">
                    <i class="bi bi-headset" style="color:#7b1fa2;font-size:1.5rem;"></i>
                    <h3 style="color:#fff;margin:0;">Call Center</h3>
                </div>
                <p style="color:#aaa;font-size:.82rem;margin-bottom:14px;">Bulut çağrı merkezi — operatör + opsiyonel modüller</p>

                <details class="plk" open>
                    <summary><span>Operatör (Temel)</span><span class="plk-price">700 ₺/ay</span></summary>
                    <div class="plk-body">
                        <ul>
                            <li>SIP tabanlı çağrı altyapısı</li>
                            <li>Çoklu kuyruk yönetimi</li>
                            <li>Çağrı kaydı (KVKK uyumlu)</li>
                            <li>Canlı supervisor paneli</li>
                            <li>Gerçek zamanlı raporlar</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p style="margin-top:6px;color:#aaa;font-size:.78rem;">Her operatör için ayrı tahakkuk.</p>
                    </div>
                </details>
                <details class="plk">
                    <summary><span>Sesli Yanıt Sistemi (IVR)</span><span class="plk-price">30.000 ₺/ay</span></summary>
                    <div class="plk-body">
                        <ul>
                            <li>Otomatik karşılama ve menü</li>
                            <li>Metin-seslendirme (TTS)</li>
                            <li>DTMF yönlendirme</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </details>
                <details class="plk">
                    <summary><span>Sesli Yönlendirme</span><span class="plk-price">30.000 ₺/ay</span></summary>
                    <div class="plk-body">
                        <ul>
                            <li>Akıllı çağrı yönlendirme (skill tabanlı)</li>
                            <li>Saat/gün bazlı kural motoru</li>
                            <li>Çağrı kuyruğu optimizasyonu</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </details>

                <a href="mailto:info@corplynk.com?subject=Call Center Talebi" style="margin-top:14px;padding:10px;background:#7b1fa2;color:#fff;text-align:center;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Teklif İste</a>
            </div>

            <!-- CRM -->
            <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:12px;padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;">
                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:4px;">
                    <i class="bi bi-people-fill" style="color:#7b1fa2;font-size:1.5rem;"></i>
                    <h3 style="color:#fff;margin:0;">CRM</h3>
                </div>
                <p style="color:#aaa;font-size:.82rem;margin-bottom:14px;">Müşteri ilişkileri ve satış süreci</p>

                <details class="plk" open>
                    <summary><span>Temel Paket</span><span class="plk-price">2.000 ₺/ay</span></summary>
                    <div class="plk-body">
                        <ul>
                            <li>Müşteri + kişi yönetimi</li>
                            <li>Satış fırsatı takibi (pipeline)</li>
                            <li>Görev + takvim entegrasyonu</li>
                            <li>E-posta şablonları</li>
                            <li>Ekip işbirliği</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </details>

                <p style="color:#888;font-size:.8rem;margin-top:10px;text-align:center;"><em>Diğer modüller yakında.</em></p>

                <a href="mailto:info@corplynk.com?subject=CRM Talebi" style="margin-top:auto;padding:10px;background:#7b1fa2;color:#fff;text-align:center;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">5 Gün Ücretsiz Dene</a>
            </div>

        </div>
        <p style="text-align:center;color:#888;margin-top:24px;font-size:.85rem;">Tüm fiyatlar <strong>KDV dahil</strong>dir. Ödeme kredi/banka kartı ile <strong>iyzico</strong> altyapısı üzerinden alınır.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Salon Customers CTA -->
    <section class="salon-cta-section" id="book">
        <div class="section-header">
            <div class="section-badge"><t key="landing.booking.badge">Online Booking</t></div>
            <h2 class="section-title"><t key="landing.booking.title">Book Your Salon Appointment Online</t></h2>
            <p class="section-desc"><t key="landing.booking.subtitle">Find nearby salons, compare prices, and book appointments instantly. No phone calls needed.</t></p>
        </div>
        <div class="booking-features">
            <div class="booking-feature">
                <div class="booking-icon"><i class="bi bi-geo-alt-fill"></i></div>
                <h4><t key="landing.booking.find">Find Nearby Salons</t></h4>
                <p><t key="landing.booking.find.desc">Discover hair salons, beauty centers, and spas in your area with real-time availability.</t></p>
            </div>
            <div class="booking-feature">
                <div class="booking-icon"><i class="bi bi-calendar-check-fill"></i></div>
                <h4><t key="landing.booking.book">Book Instantly</t></h4>
                <p><t key="landing.booking.book.desc">Choose your service, pick a time slot, and confirm your appointment in seconds.</t></p>
            </div>
            <div class="booking-feature">
                <div class="booking-icon"><i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i></div>
                <h4><t key="landing.booking.safe">Safe & Secure</t></h4>
                <p><t key="landing.booking.safe.desc">Your personal data is never shared with salons you haven't joined. KVKK compliant.</t></p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="booking-cta">
            <a href="https://sln.corplynk.com/discover" class="cta-btn cta-primary">
                <span><t key="landing.booking.cta">Discover Salons</t></span>
                <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i>
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Tech Stack -->
    <section class="tech-section" id="about">
        <div class="section-header">
            <div class="section-badge"><t key="landing.tech.badge">Technology</t></div>
            <h2 class="section-title"><t key="landing.tech.title">Built with Modern Stack</t></h2>
            <p class="section-desc"><t key="landing.tech.subtitle">Enterprise-grade architecture with security and performance at its core.</t></p>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-grid">
            <div class="tech-item">
                <div class="tech-icon"><i class="bi bi-filetype-cs"></i></div>
                <span>.NET 10</span>
            </div>
            <div class="tech-item">
                <div class="tech-icon"><i class="bi bi-database"></i></div>
                <span>PostgreSQL</span>
            </div>
            <div class="tech-item">
                <div class="tech-icon"><i class="bi bi-lightning-charge"></i></div>
                <span>SignalR</span>
            </div>
            <div class="tech-item">
                <div class="tech-icon"><i class="bi bi-window"></i></div>
                <span>Blazor</span>
            </div>
            <div class="tech-item">
                <div class="tech-icon"><i class="bi bi-cloud"></i></div>
                <span>Google Cloud</span>
            </div>
            <div class="tech-item">
                <div class="tech-icon"><i class="bi bi-lock"></i></div>
                <span>AES-256</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Contact / Waitlist -->
    <section class="contact-section" id="contact">
        <div class="section-header">
            <div class="section-badge"><t key="landing.contact.badge">Stay Updated</t></div>
            <h2 class="section-title"><t key="landing.contact.title">Get Early Access</t></h2>
            <p class="section-desc"><t key="landing.contact.subtitle">Join our mailing list to get notified about updates, new features, and early access to our products.</t></p>
        </div>

        <div class="waitlist-card" id="waitlistForm">
            <form id="waitlistFormInner" class="waitlist-form" autocomplete="off">
                <input
                    type="email"
                    id="waitlistEmail"
                    class="waitlist-input"
                    placeholder="@T.T("landing.contact.placeholder", "Enter your email")"
                    required
                />
                <button type="submit" id="waitlistBtn" class="waitlist-btn">
                    <span id="waitlistBtnText"><t key="landing.contact.subscribe">Subscribe</t></span>
                    <span id="waitlistSpinner" class="spinner-border spinner-border-sm" role="status" style="display: none;"></span>
                    <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i>
                </button>
            </form>
            <div id="waitlistError" class="waitlist-error"></div>
            <div id="waitlistSuccess" class="waitlist-success">
                <div class="check-icon"><i class="bi bi-check-lg"></i></div>
                <h4><t key="landing.contact.success.title">You're on the list!</t></h4>
                <p><t key="landing.contact.success.desc">We'll keep you updated on all things CorpLynk.</t></p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="social-proof" id="socialProof" style="display: none;">
            <div class="avatar-stack">
                <div class="avatar">A</div>
                <div class="avatar">M</div>
                <div class="avatar">S</div>
                <div class="avatar">+</div>
            </div>
            <span><t key="landing.contact.join">Join</t> <span class="count" id="waitlistCount">0</span> <t key="landing.contact.others">others</t></span>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="landing-footer">
        <div class="footer-top">
            <div class="footer-brand">
                <a href="@langPrefix" class="landing-brand">
                    <i class="bi bi-hexagon-fill"></i> CorpLynk
                </a>
                <p><t key="landing.footer.desc">Enterprise software solutions that connect businesses.</t></p>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-col">
                <h4><t key="landing.nav.products">Products</t></h4>
                <a href="@langPrefix/call-center"><t key="landing.cc.name">Cloud Call Center</t></a>
                <a href="https://sln.corplynk.com"><t key="landing.salon.name">Salon Management</t></a>
                <a href="@langPrefix/b2b-trade"><t key="landing.b2b.name">B2B Trade Platform</t></a>
                <a href="@langPrefix/download"><t key="landing.nav.download">Download</t></a>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-col">
                <h4><t key="landing.footer.company">Company</t></h4>
                <a href="#about"><t key="landing.nav.about">About</t></a>
                <a href="#contact"><t key="landing.nav.contact">Contact</t></a>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-col">
                <h4><t key="landing.footer.connect">Connect</t></h4>
                <a href="https://x.com/corplynkcmon" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><i class="bi bi-twitter-x"></i> Twitter</a>
                <a href="mailto:info@corplynk.com"><i class="bi bi-envelope"></i> Email</a>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-col">
                <h4>Yasal</h4>
                <a href="/hakkimizda">Hakkımızda</a>
                <a href="/privacy">Gizlilik Politikası</a>
                <a href="/kvkk">KVKK Aydınlatma</a>
                <a href="/mesafeli-satis-sozlesmesi">Mesafeli Satış</a>
                <a href="/teslimat">Teslimat Politikası</a>
                <a href="/iptal-iade">İptal ve İade</a>
                <a href="/kullanici-sozlesmesi">Kullanıcı Sözleşmesi</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Odeme Logolari (Iyzico basvuru gereksinimi) -->
        <div style="text-align:center;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);margin-top:20px;">
            <p style="color:#aaa;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:12px;">Güvenli ödeme iyzico altyapısı ile sağlanmaktadır.</p>
            <div style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;">
                <img src="~/img/visa.svg" asp-append-version="true" alt="Visa" style="height:36px;width:auto;background:#fff;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:4px;box-sizing:content-box;" />
                <img src="~/img/mastercard.svg" asp-append-version="true" alt="Mastercard" style="height:36px;background:#fff;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:4px;box-sizing:content-box;" />
                <a href="https://www.iyzico.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="display:inline-block;background:#1e65a7;color:#fff;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:4px;font-weight:700;font-size:.9rem;text-decoration:none;">iyzico ile Öde</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-bottom">
            <p>&copy; 2026 CorpLynk. Tum haklari saklidir.</p>
        </div>
    </footer>
</div>

